msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Music integrations"
msgstr "音乐软件集成"

msgid "How to enable player integration"
msgstr "如何启用播放器集成"

msgid "Launcher updated. Restart the player using its Panon menu entry."
msgstr "启动项已更新，请从带有“Panon 集成”的菜单入口重新启动播放器。"

msgid "Launcher update failed: %1"
msgstr "更新启动项失败：%1"

msgid "1. Auto-detect the application package and Electron runtime, or fill them manually.\n2. Click Update integration launcher to create a separate .desktop entry in your user applications directory ($XDG_DATA_HOME/applications, normally ~/.local/share/applications). The original launcher and player files are unchanged.\n3. Fully quit the player, including its tray process, then open the new NetEase/QQ Music (Panon) entry from the application menu. The original entry does not enable the lyrics bridge.\n4. Apply saves these fields only; it does not update the .desktop entry. After moving Panon or changing paths, update the launcher again."
msgstr "1. 点击“自动检测”填写应用包和 Electron 路径，也可手动填写。\n2. 点击“更新集成启动项”，在用户应用目录（$XDG_DATA_HOME/applications，通常为 ~/.local/share/applications）生成独立的 .desktop 文件，不修改原启动项或播放器文件。\n3. 完全退出播放器（包括托盘后台），再从应用菜单打开“网易云音乐 / QQ音乐（Panon 集成）”。原入口不会启用歌词桥接。\n4. “应用”只保存本页输入值，不会更新 .desktop 启动项。移动 Panon 或更改路径后，请再次更新启动项。"
